              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehoyakina umwami w’i Buyuda ava mu gisagara, bo na nyina n’ abantu biwe n’abo mu nda y’ ingoma n’abamenyekana biwe, aja kwisaba uwo mwami w’i Babuloni, na we aramufata; ico gihe umwami w’i Babuloni yar’ amaze imyaka munani ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
