        },
        {
          "text": "Asahura ibitunzwe vyose mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, bo n’ivyo mu ngoro y’umwami, amenagura n’ ibintu vyose vy’imbombovu vy’ izahabu vyari mu rusengero rw’ Uhoraho, ivyo Salomo umwami w’Abisirayeli yari yaracurishije, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yavuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
