        {
          "text": "Ajana ab’i Yerusalemu bose ar’ inyagano, hamwe n’abo mu nda y’ ingoma bose, n’abahizi bose; abāfashwe bose na bose bār’ ibihumbi cumi, hamwe n’ababāji n’abacuzi bose; nta wasigaye mur’ ico gihugu atari ba nyarucari bo hanyuma y’abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
