        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ajana Yehoyakina i Babuloni, ajana n’ umugabekazi, n’abamikazi biwe, n’abamenyekana biwe, n’abaganwa bo mur’ ico gihugu, abakūra i Yerusalemu abajana i Babuloni ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
