              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abantu bose b’abahizi, bashika ibihumbi ndwi, bo n’ababāji n’abacuzi igihumbi, bose b’abanyenkomezi bazi kurwana, bose umwami w’i Babuloni abajana i we i Babuloni ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
