        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekiya yagiye ku ngoma amaze imyaka mirongwibiri n’ umwe; ayimarakw imyaka cumi n’umwe i Yerusalemu; nyina yitwa Hamutali umukobga wa Yeremiya w’i Libuna. ",
