              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ivyabaye i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda vyavuye ku burake bg’ Uhoraho, gushitsa ah’ amaramarije kubirukana imbere yiwe.",
